/li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4" href="#How_to_Store_Sunflower_Seeds_and_Their_Shelf_Life%EF%BC%9F" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_12" data-source="" data-orig="How to Store Sunflower Seeds and Their Shelf Life？">How to Store Sunflower Seeds and Their Shelf Life？</span></a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5" href="#Applications_of_Sunflower_Seed_Kernels_in_Food_Processing" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_13" data-source="" data-orig="Applications of Sunflower Seed Kernels in Food Processing">Applications of Sunflower Seed Kernels in Food Processing</span></a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6" href="#How_to_Identify_Spoiled_Sunflower_Seeds" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_14" data-source="" data-orig="How to Identify Spoiled Sunflower Seeds">How to Identify Spoiled Sunflower Seeds</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7" href="#How_to_Eat_Shelled_Sunflower_Seeds_Can_They_Be_Eaten_with_the_Shell" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_15" data-source="" data-orig="How to Eat Shelled Sunflower Seeds">How to Eat Shelled Sunflower Seeds</span>? <span class ="tr_" id="tr_16" data-source="" data-orig="Can They Be Eaten with the Shell">Can They Be Eaten with the Shell</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8" href="#Do_Sunflower_Seed_Shells_Contain_Nutrients" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_17" data-source="" data-orig="Do Sunflower Seed Shells Contain Nutrients">Do Sunflower Seed Shells Contain Nutrients</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9" href="#Are_There_Other_Uses_for_Sunflower_Seed_Shells" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_18" data-source="" data-orig="Are There Other Uses for Sunflower Seed Shells">Are There Other Uses for Sunflower Seed Shells</span>?</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Nutritional_Content_of_Sunflower_Seeds"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_19" data-source="" data-orig="Nutritional Content of Sunflower Seeds">Nutritional Content of Sunflower Seeds</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_20" data-source="" data-orig="Sunflower seeds are rich in several beneficial nutrients">Sunflower seeds are rich in several beneficial nutrients</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_21" data-source="" data-orig="Here are the main nutritional components along with their benefits">Here are the main nutritional components along with their benefits</span>:</p><ul><li><strong>지방</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_22" data-source="" data-orig="Sunflower seeds contain up to">Sunflower seeds contain up to</span> 50% 지방, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_23" data-source="" data-orig="mainly unsaturated fatty acids">mainly unsaturated fatty acids</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_24" data-source="" data-orig="with linoleic acid comprising about">with linoleic acid comprising about</span> 70%. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_25" data-source="" data-orig="This high level of unsaturated fatty acids helps lower cholesterol and protects cardiovascular health">This high level of unsaturated fatty acids helps lower cholesterol and protects cardiovascular health</span>.</li><li><strong>단백질</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_26" data-source="" data-orig="The protein content is about">The protein content is about</span> 30%, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_27" data-source="" data-orig="comparable to soybeans">comparable to soybeans</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_28" data-source="" data-orig="lean meat">lean meat</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_29" data-source="" data-orig="eggs">eggs</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_30" data-source="" data-orig="and milk">and milk</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_31" data-source="" data-orig="Arginine">Arginine</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_32" data-source="" data-orig="an essential component for sperm production">an essential component for sperm production</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_33" data-source="" data-orig="is also present">is also present</span>.</li><li><strong>비타민 E</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_34" data-source="" data-orig="Sunflower seeds are a good source of Vitamin E">Sunflower seeds are a good source of Vitamin E</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_35" data-source="" data-orig="containing">containing</span> 50% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_36" data-source="" data-orig="more than peanuts">more than peanuts</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_37" data-source="" data-orig="Vitamin E helps prevent aging">Vitamin E helps prevent aging</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_38" data-source="" data-orig="boosts immunity">boosts immunity</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_39" data-source="" data-orig="and reduces the risk of cardiovascular diseases">and reduces the risk of cardiovascular diseases</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_40" data-source="" data-orig="Vitamin B1 and B2">Vitamin B1 and B2</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_41" data-source="" data-orig="They are rich in vitamins B1 and B2">They are rich in vitamins B1 and B2</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_42" data-source="" data-orig="which support the normal function of nerves and muscle tissues">which support the normal function of nerves and muscle tissues</span>.</li><li><strong>탄산수</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_43" data-source="" data-orig="Sunflower seeds are rich in trace elements such as iron">Sunflower seeds are rich in trace elements such as iron</span>, 아연, 칼륨, 그리고 마그네슘. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_44" data-source="" data-orig="The potassium content is particularly high">The potassium content is particularly high</span>, ~와 함께 920 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_45" data-source="" data-orig="mg per">mg per</span> 100 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_46" data-source="" data-orig="grams of seeds">grams of seeds</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_47" data-source="" data-orig="These minerals help prevent anemia">These minerals help prevent anemia</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_48" data-source="" data-orig="protect heart function">protect heart function</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_49" data-source="" data-orig="and prevent hypertension">and prevent hypertension</span>.</li><li><strong>식이섬유</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_50" data-source="" data-orig="They contain a significant amount of dietary fiber">They contain a significant amount of dietary fiber</span>, ~에 대한 1 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_51" data-source="" data-orig="gram per">gram per</span> 7 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_52" data-source="" data-orig="grams of seeds">grams of seeds</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_53" data-source="" data-orig="which helps reduce the risk of colon cancer">which helps reduce the risk of colon cancer</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_54" data-source="" data-orig="Carotenoids">Carotenoids</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_55" data-source="" data-orig="Sunflower seeds contain carotenoids">Sunflower seeds contain carotenoids</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_56" data-source="" data-orig="which can be converted to Vitamin A in the body">which can be converted to Vitamin A in the body</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_57" data-source="" data-orig="helping to prevent dry skin">helping to prevent dry skin</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_58" data-source="" data-orig="Antioxidants">Antioxidants</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_59" data-source="" data-orig="Sunflower seeds are rich in Vitamin E and phenolic acids">Sunflower seeds are rich in Vitamin E and phenolic acids</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_60" data-source="" data-orig="which are antioxidants that combat harmful free radicals in the body">which are antioxidants that combat harmful free radicals in the body</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_61" data-source="" data-orig="reducing the incidence of chronic diseases like heart disease and cancer">reducing the incidence of chronic diseases like heart disease and cancer</span>.</li><li><strong>기타 영양소</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_62" data-source="" data-orig="They also contain trace elements like folate and selenium">They also contain trace elements like folate and selenium</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_63" data-source="" data-orig="which aid in vitamin absorption and utilization">which aid in vitamin absorption and utilization</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_64" data-source="" data-orig="offering high antioxidant capacity">offering high antioxidant capacity</span>.</li></ul><figure id="attachment_571-2" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-571-2" style="width: 711px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img src="/images/How-to-Eat-Sunflower-Seeds？-3-300x193.jpg" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-571" alt="How to Eat Sunflower Seeds？ " width="721" height="464" title="해바라기 씨를 먹는 방법? 알아두면 좋은 4가지 방법 5" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-571-2" class="wp-caption-text"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_65" data-source="" data-orig="How to Eat Sunflower Seeds？">How to Eat Sunflower Seeds？</span></figcaption></figure><p>그래서, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_66" data-source="" data-orig="sunflower seeds are not only a high-energy food but also packed with various nutrients beneficial for health">sunflower seeds are not only a high-energy food but also packed with various nutrients beneficial for health</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_67" data-source="" data-orig="Consuming them in moderation can provide abundant nutrition and promote overall well-being">Consuming them in moderation can provide abundant nutrition and promote overall well-being</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="So_How_to_Eat_Sunflower_Seeds"></span>그래서, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_68" data-source="" data-orig="How to Eat Sunflower Seeds">How to Eat Sunflower Seeds</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_69" data-source="" data-orig="There are many ways to eat sunflower seeds">There are many ways to eat sunflower seeds</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_70" data-source="" data-orig="whether shelled or unshelled">whether shelled or unshelled</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_71" data-source="" data-orig="depending on personal preference">depending on personal preference</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_72" data-source="" data-orig="For shelled sunflower seeds">For shelled sunflower seeds</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_73" data-source="" data-orig="common preparation methods include roasting">common preparation methods include roasting</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_74" data-source="" data-orig="boiling">boiling</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_75" data-source="" data-orig="and salting">and salting</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_76" data-source="" data-orig="These methods help retain the nutritional components while enhancing flavor">These methods help retain the nutritional components while enhancing flavor</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_77" data-source="" data-orig="Unshelled sunflower seeds have even broader applications">Unshelled sunflower seeds have even broader applications</span>; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_78" data-source="" data-orig="they can be added to salads">they can be added to salads</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_79" data-source="" data-orig="and sauces">and sauces</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_80" data-source="" data-orig="blended into powders">blended into powders</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_81" data-source="" data-orig="and incorporated into ice cream">and incorporated into ice cream</span>, 파스타, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_82" data-source="" data-orig="bread">bread</span>, 에너지 바, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_83" data-source="" data-orig="and pastries">and pastries</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_84" data-source="" data-orig="Here are a couple of specific methods for eating shelled sunflower seeds">Here are a couple of specific methods for eating shelled sunflower seeds</span>:</p><p><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_85" data-source="" data-orig="Roasting">Roasting</span>:</strong></p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_86" data-source="" data-orig="Preparation">Preparation</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_87" data-source="" data-orig="Place shelled sunflower seeds in a large bowl">Place shelled sunflower seeds in a large bowl</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_88" data-source="" data-orig="and add enough water for them to absorb moisture">and add enough water for them to absorb moisture</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_89" data-source="" data-orig="preventing them from drying out during roasting">preventing them from drying out during roasting</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_90" data-source="" data-orig="Salting">Salting</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_91" data-source="" data-orig="Add a suitable amount of salt">Add a suitable amount of salt</span> (~에 대한 1/3 에게 1/2 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_92" data-source="" data-orig="cup">cup</span>), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_93" data-source="" data-orig="mixing the seeds with the salt water">mixing the seeds with the salt water</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_94" data-source="" data-orig="Let them soak overnight to enhance flavor">Let them soak overnight to enhance flavor</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_95" data-source="" data-orig="Draining">Draining</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_96" data-source="" data-orig="The next day">The next day</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_97" data-source="" data-orig="drain the seeds">drain the seeds</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_98" data-source="" data-orig="discarding excess water">discarding excess water</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_99" data-source="" data-orig="Roasting">Roasting</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_100" data-source="" data-orig="Heat oil in a pan">Heat oil in a pan</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_101" data-source="" data-orig="add the seeds">add the seeds</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_102" data-source="" data-orig="and stir-fry on high heat for about">and stir-fry on high heat for about</span> 5 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_103" data-source="" data-orig="minutes until they turn slightly golden and make popping sounds">minutes until they turn slightly golden and make popping sounds</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_104" data-source="" data-orig="Then remove from heat">Then remove from heat</span>.</li><li><strong>청소</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_105" data-source="" data-orig="Sift through the roasted seeds to remove sand or other impurities">Sift through the roasted seeds to remove sand or other impurities</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_106" data-source="" data-orig="ensuring they are clean and safe to eat">ensuring they are clean and safe to eat</span>.</li></ul><p><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_107" data-source="" data-orig="Boiling">Boiling</span>:</strong></p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_108" data-source="" data-orig="Preparation">Preparation</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_109" data-source="" data-orig="Use fresh">Use fresh</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_110" data-source="" data-orig="unshelled sunflower seeds that are dry">unshelled sunflower seeds that are dry</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_111" data-source="" data-orig="odorless">odorless</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_112" data-source="" data-orig="and mold-free">and mold-free</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_113" data-source="" data-orig="Soaking">Soaking</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_114" data-source="" data-orig="Place the seeds in a large bowl with enough water to cover them completely">Place the seeds in a large bowl with enough water to cover them completely</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_115" data-source="" data-orig="This allows them to absorb moisture for boiling">This allows them to absorb moisture for boiling</span>.</li><li><strong>요리</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_116" data-source="" data-orig="Boil the soaked seeds in a pot with sufficient water">Boil the soaked seeds in a pot with sufficient water</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_117" data-source="" data-orig="After boiling">After boiling</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_118" data-source="" data-orig="switch to medium-low heat and cook until fully cooked">switch to medium-low heat and cook until fully cooked</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_119" data-source="" data-orig="Flavoring">Flavoring</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_120" data-source="" data-orig="You can add salt or other seasonings during the boiling process according to taste">You can add salt or other seasonings during the boiling process according to taste</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_121" data-source="" data-orig="After cooking">After cooking</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_122" data-source="" data-orig="drain and let the seeds dry">drain and let the seeds dry</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_123" data-source="" data-orig="Storage">Storage</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_124" data-source="" data-orig="Boiled seeds should be consumed quickly due to their high-fat content">Boiled seeds should be consumed quickly due to their high-fat content</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_125" data-source="" data-orig="which can lead to spoilage">which can lead to spoilage</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_126" data-source="" data-orig="If needed">If needed</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_127" data-source="" data-orig="store them in a sealed container in the fridge or freezer">store them in a sealed container in the fridge or freezer</span>.</li></ul><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_128" data-source="" data-orig="For unshelled sunflower seeds">For unshelled sunflower seeds</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_129" data-source="" data-orig="here are a few methods of preparation">here are a few methods of preparation</span>:</p><p><strong>소스:</strong></p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_130" data-source="" data-orig="Preparation">Preparation</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_131" data-source="" data-orig="Gather sunflower seeds along with other ingredients for the sauce">Gather sunflower seeds along with other ingredients for the sauce</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_132" data-source="" data-orig="such as orange juice">such as orange juice</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_133" data-source="" data-orig="rice vinegar">rice vinegar</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_134" data-source="" data-orig="sunflower oil">sunflower oil</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_135" data-source="" data-orig="and honey">and honey</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_136" data-source="" data-orig="Shelling">Shelling</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_137" data-source="" data-orig="Remove the shells from the sunflower seeds using a shelling tool for easier use">Remove the shells from the sunflower seeds using a shelling tool for easier use</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_138" data-source="" data-orig="Making the Sauce">Making the Sauce</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_139" data-source="" data-orig="Blend orange juice">Blend orange juice</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_140" data-source="" data-orig="rice vinegar">rice vinegar</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_141" data-source="" data-orig="sunflower oil">sunflower oil</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_142" data-source="" data-orig="and honey in a blender until smooth">and honey in a blender until smooth</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_143" data-source="" data-orig="Then">Then</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_144" data-source="" data-orig="add the shelled sunflower seeds and blend again to mix well">add the shelled sunflower seeds and blend again to mix well</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_145" data-source="" data-orig="Storage and Use">Storage and Use</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_146" data-source="" data-orig="Store the sauce in a sealed container in the fridge for up to two weeks">Store the sauce in a sealed container in the fridge for up to two weeks</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_147" data-source="" data-orig="This sauce can be used on salads">This sauce can be used on salads</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_148" data-source="" data-orig="dishes">dishes</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_149" data-source="" data-orig="or as a dressing">or as a dressing</span>.</li></ul><p><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_150" data-source="" data-orig="Baking">Baking</span>:</strong></p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_151" data-source="" data-orig="Baking">Baking</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_152" data-source="" data-orig="Combine sunflower seeds with flour">Combine sunflower seeds with flour</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_153" data-source="" data-orig="eggs">eggs</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_154" data-source="" data-orig="milk">milk</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_155" data-source="" data-orig="and sugar to create a batter">and sugar to create a batter</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_156" data-source="" data-orig="then pour it into a mold and bake to make cakes or cookies">then pour it into a mold and bake to make cakes or cookies</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_157" data-source="" data-orig="Cookie Preparation">Cookie Preparation</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_158" data-source="" data-orig="Mix sunflower seeds">Mix sunflower seeds</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_159" data-source="" data-orig="sugar">sugar</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_160" data-source="" data-orig="whole egg liquid">whole egg liquid</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_161" data-source="" data-orig="and milk in a blender until smooth">and milk in a blender until smooth</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_162" data-source="" data-orig="then add low-gluten flour and baking soda to form a dough">then add low-gluten flour and baking soda to form a dough</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_163" data-source="" data-orig="shaping it into cookies and baking">shaping it into cookies and baking</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_164" data-source="" data-orig="Pastry Making">Pastry Making</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_165" data-source="" data-orig="Combine sunflower seeds with low-gluten flour">Combine sunflower seeds with low-gluten flour</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_166" data-source="" data-orig="egg liquid">egg liquid</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_167" data-source="" data-orig="milk">milk</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_168" data-source="" data-orig="brown sugar">brown sugar</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_169" data-source="" data-orig="white sugar">white sugar</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_170" data-source="" data-orig="and baking soda to form dough">and baking soda to form dough</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_171" data-source="" data-orig="shape it into balls">shape it into balls</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_172" data-source="" data-orig="and bake">and bake</span>.</li></ul><p>결론적으로, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_173" data-source="" data-orig="sunflower seeds can be enjoyed in many ways">sunflower seeds can be enjoyed in many ways</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_174" data-source="" data-orig="whether shelled or unshelled">whether shelled or unshelled</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_175" data-source="" data-orig="and they are rich in nutritional value">and they are rich in nutritional value</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Eating_Raw_vs_Roasted_Sunflower_Seeds"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_176" data-source="" data-orig="Eating Raw vs">Eating Raw vs</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_177" data-source="" data-orig="Roasted Sunflower Seeds">Roasted Sunflower Seeds</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><figure id="attachment_572-2" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-572-2" style="width: 717px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img src="/images/How-to-Eat-Sunflower-Seeds？-2-300x192.jpg" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-572" alt="How to Eat Sunflower Seeds？ " width="727" height="465" title="해바라기 씨를 먹는 방법? 알아두면 좋은 4가지 방법 6" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-572-2" class="wp-caption-text"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_178" data-source="" data-orig="How to Eat Sunflower Seeds？">How to Eat Sunflower Seeds？</span></figcaption></figure><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_179" data-source="" data-orig="Raw and roasted sunflower seeds have different consumption methods">Raw and roasted sunflower seeds have different consumption methods</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_180" data-source="" data-orig="For raw sunflower seeds">For raw sunflower seeds</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_181" data-source="" data-orig="the simplest way to enjoy them is to eat them raw">the simplest way to enjoy them is to eat them raw</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_182" data-source="" data-orig="They require no processing">They require no processing</span>; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_183" data-source="" data-orig="just wash them and eat">just wash them and eat</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_184" data-source="" data-orig="Raw sunflower seeds are rich in unsaturated fatty acids">Raw sunflower seeds are rich in unsaturated fatty acids</span>, 비타민, 추적 요소, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_185" data-source="" data-orig="providing benefits such as cardiovascular protection and anemia prevention">providing benefits such as cardiovascular protection and anemia prevention</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_186" data-source="" data-orig="Roasted sunflower seeds are typically consumed after roasting or baking">Roasted sunflower seeds are typically consumed after roasting or baking</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_187" data-source="" data-orig="Roasting involves cleaning the seeds and frying them until done">Roasting involves cleaning the seeds and frying them until done</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_188" data-source="" data-orig="Baking involves placing the seeds in the oven for">Baking involves placing the seeds in the oven for</span> 10-15 분. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_189" data-source="" data-orig="Roasted seeds have a crunchy">Roasted seeds have a crunchy</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_190" data-source="" data-orig="sweet flavor and are often preferred over raw seeds">sweet flavor and are often preferred over raw seeds</span>. 또한, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_191" data-source="" data-orig="roasted sunflower seeds can be crushed and used in stir-fried dishes">roasted sunflower seeds can be crushed and used in stir-fried dishes</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_192" data-source="" data-orig="Note that sunflower seeds are considered">Note that sunflower seeds are considered</span> &#8220;<span class ="tr_" id="tr_193" data-source="" data-orig="warming">warming</span>,&#8221; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_194" data-source="" data-orig="so they should be consumed in moderation to avoid excessive heat in the body">so they should be consumed in moderation to avoid excessive heat in the body</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_to_Store_Sunflower_Seeds_and_Their_Shelf_Life%EF%BC%9F"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_195" data-source="" data-orig="How to Store Sunflower Seeds and Their Shelf Life？">How to Store Sunflower Seeds and Their Shelf Life？</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_196" data-source="" data-orig="The storage conditions and shelf life of sunflower seeds greatly depend on the environment in which they are stored">The storage conditions and shelf life of sunflower seeds greatly depend on the environment in which they are stored</span>. 예를 들어, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_197" data-source="" data-orig="storage in a greenhouse differs from storage in a refrigerator">storage in a greenhouse differs from storage in a refrigerator</span>.</p><p><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_198" data-source="" data-orig="Greenhouse Storage">Greenhouse Storage</span>:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>방법</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_199" data-source="" data-orig="Store sunflower seeds in a cool">Store sunflower seeds in a cool</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_200" data-source="" data-orig="dry place away from mice and pests">dry place away from mice and pests</span>.</li><li><strong>유통기한</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_201" data-source="" data-orig="Raw sunflower seeds can be stored for about">Raw sunflower seeds can be stored for about</span> 3 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_202" data-source="" data-orig="months in a greenhouse">months in a greenhouse</span>.</li></ul><p><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_203" data-source="" data-orig="Refrigerator Storage">Refrigerator Storage</span>:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>방법</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_204" data-source="" data-orig="If sunflower seeds are shelled">If sunflower seeds are shelled</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_205" data-source="" data-orig="ground">ground</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_206" data-source="" data-orig="chopped">chopped</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_207" data-source="" data-orig="or made into butter">or made into butter</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_208" data-source="" data-orig="they can be vacuum-sealed or frozen">they can be vacuum-sealed or frozen</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_209" data-source="" data-orig="Note that roasted sunflower seeds should not be frozen">Note that roasted sunflower seeds should not be frozen</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_210" data-source="" data-orig="as their low moisture content can lead to moisture absorption in the fridge">as their low moisture content can lead to moisture absorption in the fridge</span>.</li><li><strong>유통기한</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_211" data-source="" data-orig="Roasted sunflower seeds can be stored for about">Roasted sunflower seeds can be stored for about</span> 6 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_212" data-source="" data-orig="months in the refrigerator">months in the refrigerator</span>.</li></ul><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Applications_of_Sunflower_Seed_Kernels_in_Food_Processing"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_213" data-source="" data-orig="Applications of Sunflower Seed Kernels in Food Processing">Applications of Sunflower Seed Kernels in Food Processing</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><figure id="attachment_573-2" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-573-2" style="width: 712px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img src="/images/How-to-Eat-Sunflower-Seeds？-300x197.jpg" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-573" alt="How to Eat Sunflower Seeds？" width="722" height="474" title="해바라기 씨를 먹는 방법? 알아두면 좋은 4가지 방법 7" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-573-2" class="wp-caption-text"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_214" data-source="" data-orig="How to Eat Sunflower Seeds？">How to Eat Sunflower Seeds？</span></figcaption></figure><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_215" data-source="" data-orig="In food processing">In food processing</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_216" data-source="" data-orig="sunflower seed kernels are widely used as an ingredient">sunflower seed kernels are widely used as an ingredient</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_217" data-source="" data-orig="They are essential in the production of pastries and candies">They are essential in the production of pastries and candies</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_218" data-source="" data-orig="which are popular among consumers with a continuously growing market demand">which are popular among consumers with a continuously growing market demand</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_219" data-source="" data-orig="Sunflower seed kernels are also used in making snacks">Sunflower seed kernels are also used in making snacks</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_220" data-source="" data-orig="such as roasted or baked products">such as roasted or baked products</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_221" data-source="" data-orig="appreciated for their unique flavor and texture">appreciated for their unique flavor and texture</span>.</p><p>또한, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_222" data-source="" data-orig="sunflower seed kernels can be processed into flavored foods">sunflower seed kernels can be processed into flavored foods</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_223" data-source="" data-orig="such as candy-coated sunflower seeds">such as candy-coated sunflower seeds</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_224" data-source="" data-orig="which extend shelf life while preserving their unique taste">which extend shelf life while preserving their unique taste</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_225" data-source="" data-orig="Rich in linoleic acid">Rich in linoleic acid</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_226" data-source="" data-orig="they can also be made into health drinks and yogurt">they can also be made into health drinks and yogurt</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_227" data-source="" data-orig="In functional foods">In functional foods</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_228" data-source="" data-orig="chlorogenic acid extracted from sunflower seeds is used as a natural antioxidant and food additive to stabilize natural colorants">chlorogenic acid extracted from sunflower seeds is used as a natural antioxidant and food additive to stabilize natural colorants</span>. 게다가, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_229" data-source="" data-orig="sunflower protein has excellent functional properties">sunflower protein has excellent functional properties</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_230" data-source="" data-orig="such as oil absorption">such as oil absorption</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_231" data-source="" data-orig="emulsification">emulsification</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_232" data-source="" data-orig="and foaming">and foaming</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_233" data-source="" data-orig="making it widely used in the food industry in products like bread">making it widely used in the food industry in products like bread</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_234" data-source="" data-orig="baby food">baby food</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_235" data-source="" data-orig="meat products">meat products</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_236" data-source="" data-orig="and plant-based milk">and plant-based milk</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_237" data-source="" data-orig="Sunflower seed kernels are utilized across a wide range of food processing applications">Sunflower seed kernels are utilized across a wide range of food processing applications</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_238" data-source="" data-orig="from traditional snacks to modern functional foods">from traditional snacks to modern functional foods</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_239" data-source="" data-orig="showcasing their high development value and broad market prospects">showcasing their high development value and broad market prospects</span>.</p><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow"><div class="min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" dir="auto" data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="2d660d09-3190-42df-9f21-2ffad1473133" data-message-model-slug="gpt-4o"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light"><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_to_Identify_Spoiled_Sunflower_Seeds"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_240" data-source="" data-orig="How to Identify Spoiled Sunflower Seeds">How to Identify Spoiled Sunflower Seeds</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_241" data-source="" data-orig="To determine whether sunflower seeds have gone bad">To determine whether sunflower seeds have gone bad</span>, 다음 측면을 고려하십시오:</p><ul><li><strong>모습</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_242" data-source="" data-orig="Fresh sunflower seeds have a smooth shell with uniform color and no damage">Fresh sunflower seeds have a smooth shell with uniform color and no damage</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_243" data-source="" data-orig="If you notice uneven coloring or white spots">If you notice uneven coloring or white spots</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_244" data-source="" data-orig="it may indicate moisture or mold">it may indicate moisture or mold</span>. 또한, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_245" data-source="" data-orig="black or brown spots on the seed kernels or red dots on the surface are signs of spoilage">black or brown spots on the seed kernels or red dots on the surface are signs of spoilage</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_246" data-source="" data-orig="Smell and Taste">Smell and Taste</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_247" data-source="" data-orig="Spoiled sunflower seeds may emit off-odors">Spoiled sunflower seeds may emit off-odors</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_248" data-source="" data-orig="such as moldy or burnt smells">such as moldy or burnt smells</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_249" data-source="" data-orig="If you detect rancid or unusual flavors during consumption">If you detect rancid or unusual flavors during consumption</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_250" data-source="" data-orig="avoid eating them">avoid eating them</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_251" data-source="" data-orig="Peroxide Value">Peroxide Value</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_252" data-source="" data-orig="This is an important indicator of fat oxidation in food">This is an important indicator of fat oxidation in food</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_253" data-source="" data-orig="The peroxide value of roasted sunflower seeds should be ≤0.8 grams per">The peroxide value of roasted sunflower seeds should be ≤0.8 grams per</span> 100 그램. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_254" data-source="" data-orig="Exceeding this threshold indicates spoilage">Exceeding this threshold indicates spoilage</span>.</li></ul><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_255" data-source="" data-orig="By using these methods">By using these methods</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_256" data-source="" data-orig="you can accurately assess whether sunflower seeds are spoiled">you can accurately assess whether sunflower seeds are spoiled</span>, 안전한 소비 보장.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_to_Eat_Shelled_Sunflower_Seeds_Can_They_Be_Eaten_with_the_Shell"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_257" data-source="" data-orig="How to Eat Shelled Sunflower Seeds">How to Eat Shelled Sunflower Seeds</span>? <span class ="tr_" id="tr_258" data-source="" data-orig="Can They Be Eaten with the Shell">Can They Be Eaten with the Shell</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_259" data-source="" data-orig="Shelled sunflower seeds can be eaten">Shelled sunflower seeds can be eaten</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_260" data-source="" data-orig="but it’s generally recommended not to consume them with the shell">but it’s generally recommended not to consume them with the shell</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_261" data-source="" data-orig="Although the shell retains some nutritional value">Although the shell retains some nutritional value</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_262" data-source="" data-orig="it is not edible and swallowing it may cause digestive issues">it is not edible and swallowing it may cause digestive issues</span>. 그러므로, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_263" data-source="" data-orig="when eating sunflower seeds">when eating sunflower seeds</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_264" data-source="" data-orig="it’s best to remove the shell and enjoy the kernels">it’s best to remove the shell and enjoy the kernels</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_265" data-source="" data-orig="Sunflower seeds are available in both shelled and unshelled forms">Sunflower seeds are available in both shelled and unshelled forms</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_266" data-source="" data-orig="Unshelled seeds are typically roasted for enhanced flavor and crunchiness">Unshelled seeds are typically roasted for enhanced flavor and crunchiness</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_267" data-source="" data-orig="While it is possible to eat them with the shell">While it is possible to eat them with the shell</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_268" data-source="" data-orig="for health reasons">for health reasons</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_269" data-source="" data-orig="it&#8217;s advisable to remove the shell first">it&#8217;s advisable to remove the shell first</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Do_Sunflower_Seed_Shells_Contain_Nutrients"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_270" data-source="" data-orig="Do Sunflower Seed Shells Contain Nutrients">Do Sunflower Seed Shells Contain Nutrients</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_271" data-source="" data-orig="Sunflower seed shells do contain some nutrients">Sunflower seed shells do contain some nutrients</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_272" data-source="" data-orig="but their nutritional value is relatively low">but their nutritional value is relatively low</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_273" data-source="" data-orig="The shells are primarily made up of cellulose">The shells are primarily made up of cellulose</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_274" data-source="" data-orig="hemicellulose">hemicellulose</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_275" data-source="" data-orig="and lignin">and lignin</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_276" data-source="" data-orig="which account for about">which account for about</span> 84.45% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_277" data-source="" data-orig="of their composition">of their composition</span>. 또한, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_278" data-source="" data-orig="they contain a certain proportion of fat and protein">they contain a certain proportion of fat and protein</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_279" data-source="" data-orig="along with significant amounts of carbohydrates and dietary fiber">along with significant amounts of carbohydrates and dietary fiber</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_280" data-source="" data-orig="Despite these components">Despite these components</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_281" data-source="" data-orig="the nutritional content is not high enough for sunflower seed shells to be considered a primary source of nutrition">the nutritional content is not high enough for sunflower seed shells to be considered a primary source of nutrition</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Are_There_Other_Uses_for_Sunflower_Seed_Shells"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_282" data-source="" data-orig="Are There Other Uses for Sunflower Seed Shells">Are There Other Uses for Sunflower Seed Shells</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_283" data-source="" data-orig="Sunflower seed shells have various uses and promising applications beyond animal feed and fuel">Sunflower seed shells have various uses and promising applications beyond animal feed and fuel</span>. 예를 들어:</p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_284" data-source="" data-orig="Animal Feed">Animal Feed</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_285" data-source="" data-orig="The shells can serve as a high-quality feed ingredient due to their nutritional components">The shells can serve as a high-quality feed ingredient due to their nutritional components</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_286" data-source="" data-orig="which help reduce the incidence of diarrhea in livestock">which help reduce the incidence of diarrhea in livestock</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_287" data-source="" data-orig="Pigment Extraction">Pigment Extraction</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_288" data-source="" data-orig="Sunflower seed shells can be used to extract pigments">Sunflower seed shells can be used to extract pigments</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_289" data-source="" data-orig="providing economic benefits and addressing waste and environmental concerns">providing economic benefits and addressing waste and environmental concerns</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_290" data-source="" data-orig="Biomass Energy">Biomass Energy</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_291" data-source="" data-orig="They are viewed as a potential source of biomass energy">They are viewed as a potential source of biomass energy</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_292" data-source="" data-orig="although technical feasibility can be hampered by the need for long-term investment in supply systems">although technical feasibility can be hampered by the need for long-term investment in supply systems</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_293" data-source="" data-orig="Nanocellulose Production">Nanocellulose Production</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_294" data-source="" data-orig="Sunflower seed shells can be used to produce nanocellulose">Sunflower seed shells can be used to produce nanocellulose</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_295" data-source="" data-orig="a cost-effective resource derived from industrial waste">a cost-effective resource derived from industrial waste</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_296" data-source="" data-orig="beneficial for deep processing of agricultural products and waste management">beneficial for deep processing of agricultural products and waste management</span>.</li></ul><p>또한, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_297" data-source="" data-orig="sunflower seed shells can be used to extract natural pigments">sunflower seed shells can be used to extract natural pigments</span>, 안토시아닌, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_298" data-source="" data-orig="and flavonoids">and flavonoids</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_299" data-source="" data-orig="which have applications in pharmaceuticals">which have applications in pharmaceuticals</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_300" data-source="" data-orig="food">food</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_301" data-source="" data-orig="and cosmetics">and cosmetics</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_302" data-source="" data-orig="They can also be utilized as raw materials for activated carbon">They can also be utilized as raw materials for activated carbon</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_303" data-source="" data-orig="aiding in soil improvement">aiding in soil improvement</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_304" data-source="" data-orig="wastewater treatment">wastewater treatment</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_305" data-source="" data-orig="and heavy metal absorption">and heavy metal absorption</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_306" data-source="" data-orig="Overview">Overview</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_307" data-source="" data-orig="sunflower seed shells are multifunctional by-products with extensive applications in agriculture">sunflower seed shells are multifunctional by-products with extensive applications in agriculture</span>, 식품 가공, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_308" data-source="" data-orig="energy">energy</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_309" data-source="" data-orig="and environmental sectors">and environmental sectors</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_310" data-source="" data-orig="showcasing significant potential">showcasing significant potential</span>.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="mb-2 flex gap-3 empty:hidden -ml-2"><div class="items-center justify-start rounded-xl p-1 flex"><div class="flex items-center"><p>&nbsp;</p><div class="flex"></div><div class="flex items-center pb-0"><span class="overflow-hidden text-clip whitespace-nowrap text-sm">4<span class ="tr_" id="tr_311" data-source="" data-orig="o">o</span></span></div></div></div></div>`} />
